.TH MIMI 1 "September 2026" "mimi 0.2.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mimi \- Safe macOS system cleaner and app uninstaller
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mimi
[\fISUBCOMMAND\fR] [\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mimi
is a conservative, transactional macOS system cleanup tool and reversible application uninstaller.
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
.B scan
Scan selected categories for junk files and caches without mutating anything.
.TP
.B clean
Quarantine or delete files in selected categories.
.TP
.B plan
Generate a transaction plan without modifying files.
.TP
.B apply
Apply a previously generated transaction plan.
.TP
.B restore
Restore files from a quarantine run.
.TP
.B purge
Permanently remove a quarantine run and free its space.
.TP
.B history
List previous uninstall and quarantine operations.
.TP
.B apps
Inspect and list installed applications.
.TP
.B app
Inspect or uninstall an application.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-aggressive
Run the aggressive profile.
.TP
.B \-\-android\-stale\-days \fIDAYS\fR
Retention threshold for stale Android emulator images.
.TP
.B \-\-app\-root \fIPATH\fR
Add a custom application search directory.
.TP
.B \-\-app\-target \fITARGET\fR
Target application bundle or identifier.
.TP
.B \-\-apply \fIPLAN_FILE\fR
Apply an execution plan.
.TP
.B \-\-cask
Use Homebrew cask uninstall integration.
.TP
.B \-\-clean
Run in clean mode.
.TP
.B \-\-cleaner
Interactive cleaner menu.
.TP
.B \-\-downloads\-stale\-days \fIDAYS\fR
Days before downloads are reported as stale.
.TP
.B \-\-force\-risky \fIACTIONS\fR
Authorize specific risky or irreversible actions (e.g. docker, mail, trash, orphans, purge).
.TP
.B \-\-help
Show usage help and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-include\-android
Include Android SDK caches and stale AVDs.
.TP
.B \-\-include\-caches
Include user application caches.
.TP
.B \-\-include\-claude\-cache
Include Claude local VM agent cache.
.TP
.B \-\-include\-device\-support
Include iOS DeviceSupport symbols.
.TP
.B \-\-include\-docker
Include Docker data.
.TP
.B \-\-include\-docker\-cache
Include Docker builder and layer caches.
.TP
.B \-\-include\-homebrew\-old
Include old Homebrew package versions.
.TP
.B \-\-include\-ide\-stale
Include stale IDE caches and indexes.
.TP
.B \-\-include\-ios\-backups
Include iOS device backup files.
.TP
.B \-\-include\-logs
Include system and application logs.
.TP
.B \-\-include\-mail
Include Mail download attachments cache.
.TP
.B \-\-include\-ml\-caches
Include Hugging Face and Ollama ML models.
.TP
.B \-\-include\-orphans
Include orphaned application remnant files.
.TP
.B \-\-include\-sim\-stale
Include stale iOS Simulator devices.
.TP
.B \-\-include\-timemachine
Include local Time Machine snapshot thinning.
.TP
.B \-\-include\-toolchains
Include Kotlin and Gradle native toolchains.
.TP
.B \-\-include\-trash
Include emptying the Trash.
.TP
.B \-\-include\-whatsapp
Include WhatsApp media cache.
.TP
.B \-\-interactive
Launch interactive terminal UI.
.TP
.B \-\-json
Emit JSON formatted output.
.TP
.B \-\-jsonl
Emit line-delimited JSON protocol stream.
.TP
.B \-\-keep\-data
Retain application support data during uninstall.
.TP
.B \-\-keep\-device\-support \fICOUNT\fR
Number of recent DeviceSupport symbol versions to keep.
.TP
.B \-\-keep\-logs \fIDAYS\fR
Days of application logs to retain.
.TP
.B \-\-keep\-toolchains \fICOUNT\fR
Number of toolchains to keep.
.TP
.B \-\-large\-file\-mb \fIMB\fR
Size threshold for large files in report mode.
.TP
.B \-\-limit \fIN\fR
Limit number of records in history output.
.TP
.B \-\-list
List all available categories and risk classifications.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-color
Disable ANSI color escape sequences.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-log
Do not write transcripts to disk.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-prompt
Non-interactive execution mode.
.TP
.B \-\-only \fICATEGORIES\fR
Comma-separated list of category IDs to run.
.TP
.B \-\-plan
Create a plan before executing.
.TP
.B \-\-plan\-only
Generate plan and exit without applying.
.TP
.B \-\-plan\-out \fIPATH\fR
Save plan JSON to specified file path.
.TP
.B \-\-profile \fIPROFILE\fR
Run preset profile (safe, developer, aggressive).
.TP
.B \-\-purge \fIRUN_ID\fR
Purge quarantine run by ID.
.TP
.B \-\-purge\-data
Quarantine application support data during uninstall.
.TP
.B \-\-remove\-orphans
Quarantine all uninstalled app remnants.
.TP
.B \-\-remove\-orphans\-from \fIFILE\fR
Remove remnant paths listed in a reviewed file.
.TP
.B \-\-report
Generate disk usage report.
.TP
.B \-\-request\-id \fIID\fR
Trace identifier for machine JSONL events.
.TP
.B \-\-restore \fIRUN_ID\fR
Restore quarantine run by ID.
.TP
.B \-\-scan
Run in read-only scan mode.
.TP
.B \-\-sim\-stale\-days \fIDAYS\fR
Threshold days for inactive iOS simulators.
.TP
.B \-\-skip \fICATEGORIES\fR
Comma-separated list of category IDs to exclude.
.TP
.B \-\-source \fISOURCE\fR
Filter apps by installation source (cask, mas, pkg, system).
.TP
.B \-\-system
Prepare system-scope uninstall request for root apply.
.TP
.B \-\-tmp\-stale\-days \fIDAYS\fR
Days before temporary files are eligible for cleanup.
.TP
.B \-\-vendor\-uninstaller
Run verified vendor uninstaller if available.
.TP
.B \-\-verbose
Enable diagnostic and trace logging.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print version information and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-whitelist \fIPATH\fR
Exclude path from cleanup.
.TP
.B \-\-whitelist\-preset \fIPRESET\fR
Apply common whitelist preset rules.
.TP
.B \-\-yes
Automatically confirm safe and recoverable actions.
.TP
.B \-\-zap
Remove all cask preferences and data with brew.
